  "public_request": "We need to escalate our most critical open facilities incident to Jira and document it.\n\nCheck the facilities incidents sheet (ss_incidents/ws_facilities) and find the most urgent open issue. Also review any escalation rules before processing.\n\nCreate an Incident in the 'Operations Support' Jira project, note that the ops team has been notified, and put up a Confluence page in the SP_OPS space (cloud_ops) with the incident details.",
